Messy V1.0   by Diogenes/Skid Row    /X Util
Small but  great CLI  util  to use with Ami-
Express.  Intended to  create messages  from
textfiles.   Great  in  conjunction  with  a
schedule  program  like   Cybercron  or  for
doors  which just create bulletins. 100% ASM
